### STORE TEST

### GET STORE
### GET ALL STORES
GET http://localhost:3000/api/store
### GET STORE BY ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/store/14

### CREATE STORE
### CREATE WITHOUT TOKEN
POST http://localhost:3000/api/store
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Azizi Shop"
}
